# Monthly rebalance schedule (install with: crontab deploy/crontab.example)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runs the rebalance on the last weekday of each month at 3:30 PM ET.
#
# The 28-31 day range + the weekday guard inside run_monthly.sh ensures it
# only fires on the actual last TRADING day, not just any month-end date.
#
# Times are in the VM's local timezone — set the VM to America/New_York so
# "15:30" means 3:30 PM ET (matches the NYSE MOC cut-off of 3:45 PM ET).

# minute hour day month weekday  command
  30     15   28-31 *    *       /home/ubuntu/algo_trading/deploy/run_monthly.sh >> /home/ubuntu/algo_trading/data/cron.log 2>&1
